    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1190a-a7">

                <pb facs="1267" n="1171" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1171"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-04-25"><hi rendition="#italic">April 25,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>A joint resolution of Congress, approved April 20, directed intervention for the
                    pacification and independence of the island of Cuba. The Spanish Government on
                    April 21 informed our minister at Madrid <pb facs="1268" n="1172"
                        xml:id="pg1172"/> that it considered this resolution equivalent to a
                    declaration of war, and that it had accordingly withdrawn its minister from
                    Washington and terminated all diplomatic relations. Congress has therefore, by
                    an act approved to-day, declared that a state of war exists between the two
                    countries since and including April 21. You will inform the Government to which
                    you are accredited, so that its neutrality may be assured in the existing
                    war.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sherman.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>(To all United States legations abroad.)</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
